# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md "Strips".
# layout: strip
# No pattern at all: a string of C9 bulbs along the whole strip. The
# `bulb-string-8x1` sprite is four bulbs in 8 px whose two frames trade which
# pair glows; on a `tile` layer with a zero box it repeats along a strip of
# ANY length with nothing typed in — 60 px is 7½ tiles, 300 px is 37½, and
# the last tile simply clips. Beneath it a near-black wash is the wire the
# sprite's transparent gaps let through. On a panel the same two lines
# wallpaper the whole matrix in rows of bulbs.
S - Bulb Strip
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Wire
K 06040a
L sprite 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none tile 1
N Bulbs
I @spr/bulb-string-8x1
